OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fdry evening and mostly cloudy with
OL,7,Fsome clear intervals. Remaining dry
OL,8,Fovernight with some longer clear
OL,9,Fspells developing, especially in the
OL,10,Fwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FIt will be another dry day
OL,13,Fwith a cloudy start, but bright and
OL,14,Fsunny spells breaking through the
OL,15,Fcloud to give longer sunny periods in
OL,16,Fthe afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
