OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,FMonday and Tuesday with variable cloud
OL,7,Finterspersed with bright and sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Bright spells and perhaps a
OL,9,Fshower on Wednesday with wind
OL,10,Fstrengthening in the west. Overnight
OL,11,Ffrost possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
